msgstr "Some fonts could not be downloaded – they still load from Google. Details in MarMal → Fonts."

#: modules/fonty/includes/admin.php:45 modules/fonty/includes/admin.php:58 modules/cookies/includes/souhlasy.php:213 modules/cookies/includes/souhlasy.php:236 modules/cookies/includes/souhlasy.php:251 modules/cookies/includes/zasady.php:116
