msgid "Kontrola"
msgstr "Check"

#: modules/fonty/includes/admin.php:158
msgid "Otevři web v anonymním okně → F12 → Network → do filtru napiš „fonts.g“."
msgstr "Open the website in a private window → F12 → Network → type “fonts.g” in the filter."

#: modules/fonty/includes/admin.php:159
msgid "Nesmí se objevit nic z fonts.googleapis.com ani fonts.gstatic.com. Fonty se načítají z /wp-content/uploads/marmal-fonty/."
msgstr "Nothing from fonts.googleapis.com or fonts.gstatic.com may appear. Fonts load from /wp-content/uploads/marmal-fonty/."

#: modules/fonty/includes/admin.php:160
msgid "Když se Google ještě objeví: vyčisti cache webu a hostingu. Font vložený přímo v CSS (@font-face s adresou fonts.gstatic.com) modul nepřepisuje – takový font nahraj v Breakdance → Preferences → Custom Fonts."
msgstr "If Google still appears: clear the website and hosting cache. A font placed directly in CSS (@font-face with a fonts.gstatic.com address) is not rewritten – upload such a font in Breakdance → Preferences → Custom Fonts."

